jullforensics (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial official release for Kali Linux / Debian.
  * Standardized logical acquisition adhering to ISO/IEC 27037 and 27041.
  * Brutalist UI in PySide6 with real-time device monitoring.
  * Tamper-evident chained audit log with HMAC-SHA256 and Ed25519 signing.
  * Independent CLI verification utility (jullforensics-verify).

 -- JullForensics Core Team <security@jullforensics.local>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
